        "text": "A few more things to do in Busan!\n- Jukdo Park - a pretty small park, yet very nice and relaxing, a nice view of Busan to the west of this park you have a very pretty beach. Even in ealry Janruary the beach was lovley. Lots of seaguls tho lol.\n- Haeundae Beach Train - quite nice, a bit overrated, as the train was filled with people, and i have multiple problems trying to book one of those private \"cart\" things a few days before. Even tho the train was packed, it was still nice, great view, with some lovley stops.\nFinaly:\n- SEALIFE Busan Aquarium - amazing place, lots of animals/fishes and stuff! Highly recomend.",
