    "blurb": "Population of around 370k So I spent an afternoon in this city after catching a train from Amsterdam and I found this city a lot more calmer than Amsterdam but also a lot more multicultural with fewer tourists. (There's more brown people here 🥳 ) I must have seen about 10 kebab shops just walking around the…",
